Explanation of the fix:

- In both components, we were unintentionally clearing any passed `aria-label` by hard-coding `aria-label={null}` on the `<input>`.
- By replacing that with the actual prop value (`other['aria-label']` in `Toggle`, or the pre-computed `ariaLabel` in `ToggleSmall`), the native checkbox now carries the correct accessible name and will be announced by screen readers.
